  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Toi, m<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿࠈon chéria chérie, t’es un diamant\nqui demande à être poli ! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, j’suis la reine de la mode, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !\nJ’ai relooké le monde entier !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon regard d’experte me trompe pas...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E002000720065006700610072006400200064201900650078007000650072007400650020006D0065002000740072006F006D007000650020007000610073002E002E002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as besoin d’aide !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00542019006100730020006200650073006F0069006E00200064201900610069006400650020002100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as de la chance, j’vais te relooker de la tête\naux pieds ! Tu vas pas t’en remettre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça te coûtera rien, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe. No panic !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nT’empruntes les fringues, tu kiffes, et c’est good !\nRien à payer ! Un nouveau look, ça a pas de prix !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002E002E002E00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à bouleverser les codes de la mode\ngrâce à mes services de relooking, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Relookez-moi, s’il vous plaît !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006C006F006F006B0065007A002D006D006F0069002C0020007320190069006C00200076006F0075007300200070006C006100EE0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, merci. Mon look me convient.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002C0020006D0065007200630069002E0020004D006F006E0020006C006F006F006B0020006D006500200063006F006E007600690065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No way ! Tu refuses de t’ouvrir au monde\nde la mode que je t’offre sur un plateau ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK ! Par contre, laisse-moi te prévenir...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi tu veux te changer, c’est ton choix, mais\nj’récupèrerai le look que je t’ai prêté !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPigé, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entendu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00740065006E00640075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finalement, non merci.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0061006C0065006D0065006E0074002C0020006E006F006E0020006D0065007200630069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu fais le bon choix ! Maintenant, ferme les yeux,\ntu vas être ébloui<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es magnifique, chéri<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ! Tu bouscules les codes !\nY en a pas deux comme toi à Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu pourras garder ce look jusqu’à demain matin.\nProfites-en bien et à bientôt !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voulez-vous rendre la tenue que vous avez\nempruntée ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075006C0065007A002D0076006F00750073002000720065006E0064007200650020006C0061002000740065006E00750065002000710075006500200076006F007500730020006100760065007A000A0065006D007000720075006E007400E900650020003F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
